  unitName: Count Jason (EU)
  unitId: 740144
  unitNumber: 7070
  description: Count Jason of the Golden Highlands has encountered many strong opponents
    during his journey. He has never kneeled to anyone, has overcome many Noblesse
    Shapeshifters, made a werewolf bow down, made a mermaid to swim to the bottom
    of her lake, and made a sphinx step down from his throne. Though it is said that
    he recently became quite fond of a mysterious Maiden Mantis...
  summonDesc: I hope you'll make me fight worthy oponents.
  fusionDesc: Who shall I test my strength against?
  evoDesc: Count... Lord... Those titles are nothing for me, Strength is all that
    matters.
